                        ],
                        "form": "undercrafted"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a6646a8c-76d3-4245-b240-7f1fc3c943a0",
                        "entry_id": "2fbe0cb3-3dfd-38c1-bb10-da76ed159f10",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "undercrafted"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9d23771-39d4-3fa2-b922-433e71cb633d",
                        "entry_id": "2fbe0cb3-3dfd-38c1-bb10-da76ed159f10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To outwit; to outmaneuver."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e81098b9-8bba-4deb-b0ae-06f09e6901c1",
                                "sense_id": "a9d23771-39d4-3fa2-b922-433e71cb633d",
                                "text": "In mock obeisance bow him low And he succumbs your slave: a show Of high respect will undercraft His cunning wit!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8c6894ed-e239-38a9-ae26-3b952cf03198",
                        "entry_id": "2fbe0cb3-3dfd-38c1-bb10-da76ed159f10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To make with insufficient craftsmanship."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bbc56c48-068e-45a1-9cb4-a8ddd7b159fa",
                                "sense_id": "8c6894ed-e239-38a9-ae26-3b952cf03198",
                                "text": "Quite recently I had a piece published in a special Latino issue of a respected literary magazine, and though the cast now includes Cuban and Puerto Rican writers as well, the themes are still the same, and much of the writing is disappointingly simplistic or undercrafted."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49c6a4cc-fe42-427d-bc6d-75f4b6f03733",
                                "sense_id": "8c6894ed-e239-38a9-ae26-3b952cf03198",
                                "text": "Although the unpolished nature of Chan-related figure painting is taken as a matter of course, apparition painting appears to rely largely on deskilling, the purposeful undercrafting that strained to achieve whatever the opposite of professionalism looked like in the monochrome ink medium."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f6b1c98-e247-4dd0-b218-106f588df817",
                                "sense_id": "8c6894ed-e239-38a9-ae26-3b952cf03198",
                                "text": "\"I'd infinitely rather fall into the trap of overcrafting an ad than undercrafting it,” confesses Graham Warsop, “though clearly a healthy balance is preferable. […]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48e1150a-4ddb-4ca9-94ff-ef484e4c582f",
                                "sense_id": "8c6894ed-e239-38a9-ae26-3b952cf03198",
                                "text": "While she does not explicitly say that Swift's writing is undercrafted, she relies heavily on the word “clichéd,” which implies that Swift's work is lazy or insufficiently polished."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
